<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-112.1-project-portfolio-governance-prioritization-and-stage-gate" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3545" name="W3545. Enterprise Project Portfolio Strategy &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual strategy/planning (links to VS-33/VS-36); board cycle
Frequency: Annual + quarterly
Volume: Enterprise project portfolio
Owner: PMO Director / COO
Participants: PMO Director, COO, CFO, CIO, Strategy (links to VS-33), Finance (links to VS-40/VS-17.4), Executive Committee
Source: workflow W3545 — Enterprise Project Portfolio Strategy &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3545_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3545_Lane1" name="PMO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3545_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3545_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3545_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3545_Lane2" name="COO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3545_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3545_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3545_Start4" name="Annual strategy/planning (links to VS-33/VS-36); board cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3545_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3545_Task5" name="PMO/Strategy define the enterprise project-portfolio strategy and governance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PMO/Strategy define the enterprise project-portfolio strategy and governance framework: portfolio categories (capital store/DC/renewable/fleet links to VS-20/VS-37/VS-109/VS-108/VS-06; IT/digital links to VS-27/VS-30/VS-99; transformation/regulatory), strategic alignment to corporate strategy (links to VS-33), governance bodies and authorities (links to VS-36), and the PMO operating model/charter
Responsible (R): PMO / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3545_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3545_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3545_Task6" name="PMO/Finance set the portfolio investment envelope against the capex/OpEx plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: PMO/Finance set the portfolio investment envelope against the capex/OpEx plan (links to VS-40/VS-33.1/VS-17.4) and the resource/capacity constraints (W3553); define portfolio KPIs (on-time, on-budget, benefits realization, stage-gate compliance) and the review cadence
Responsible (R): PMO / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3545_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3545_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3545_Task7" name="COO/CFO approve the portfolio strategy and PMO charter, ratify governance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: COO/CFO approve the portfolio strategy and PMO charter, ratify governance bodies and authorities, and integrate to the corporate plan (links to VS-33) and board reporting (links to VS-36); communicate to the organization
Responsible (R): COO / CFO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3545_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3545_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3545_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3545_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3545_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-137 (ensure project portfolio approval &amp; cost control.) | - operational: strategic-alignment scoring (W3547); operational: defined governance and authorities
Owner: PMO Director / COO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3545_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3545_Annotation9" targetRef="W3545_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3545_Flow11" sourceRef="W3545_Start4" targetRef="W3545_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3545_Flow12" sourceRef="W3545_Task5" targetRef="W3545_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3545_Flow13" sourceRef="W3545_Task6" targetRef="W3545_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3545_Flow14" sourceRef="W3545_Task7" targetRef="W3545_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3545_diag">
