    <bpmn:process id="W_W3546" name="W3546. Project Intake, Classification &amp; Portfolio Registration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project idea/request (from any business unit)
Frequency: Continuous + intake cycle
Volume: All project requests
Owner: PMO
Participants: PMO, Project Sponsor, Strategy (links to VS-33), Finance (links to VS-40), IT (links to VS-27), Real Estate (links to VS-20/VS-97)
Source: workflow W3546 — Project Intake, Classification &amp; Portfolio Registration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3546_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3546_Lane1" name="PMO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3546_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3546_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3546_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3546_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3546_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3546_Start3" name="Project idea/request (from any business unit)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3546_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3546_Task4" name="PMO receive and log the project request/intake: idea, sponsor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PMO receive and log the project request/intake: idea, sponsor, problem/opportunity statement, rough scope, estimated cost/benefit, category (capital/IT/transformation/regulatory), and urgency; perform initial triage (in-scope, duplicate, defer, reject)
Responsible (R): PMO / Sponsor
Accountable (A): PMO Director
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3546_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3546_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3546_Task5" name="PMO classify the project: type (capital…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: PMO classify the project: type (capital store/DC/renewable/fleet/IT/transformation/regulatory), size/tier (major/minor/small-works), delivery approach (waterfall/agile/hybrid), and the applicable stage-gate (W3548) and authority (links to VS-36/VS-40); route to the relevant delivery-domain VS (VS-20/VS-37/VS-109/VS-108/VS-27/etc.)
Responsible (R): PMO
Accountable (A): PMO Director
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3546_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3546_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3546_Task6" name="PMO register the project in the portfolio/PMIS (links to W3562), assign a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PMO register the project in the portfolio/PMIS (links to W3562), assign a project ID/charter-draft, and queue for prioritization (W3547) and approval (W3551); maintain the portfolio register and pipeline view
Responsible (R): PMO
Accountable (A): PMO Director
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3546_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3546_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3546_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3546_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3546_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-137 (ensure project portfolio approval &amp; cost control.) | - operational: intake discipline and visibility; operational: classification standard (W3548)
Owner: PMO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3546_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3546_Annotation8" targetRef="W3546_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3546_Flow10" sourceRef="W3546_Start3" targetRef="W3546_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3546_Flow11" sourceRef="W3546_Task4" targetRef="W3546_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3546_Flow12" sourceRef="W3546_Task5" targetRef="W3546_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3546_Flow13" sourceRef="W3546_Task6" targetRef="W3546_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3546_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3546_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3546">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3546_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3546_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
