      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategic initiative requiring multiple projects (e.g., ERP rollout, net-zero/renewable, omnichannel, 50-store expansion wave)
Frequency: Per program
Volume: Active programs
Owner: Program Manager / PMO
Participants: Program Manager, PMO, Sponsors, Project Managers, Strategy (links to VS-33), Innovation/Digital (links to VS-30), Finance (links to VS-40)
Source: workflow W3549 — Program Management (Multi-Project Initiatives)</bpmn:documentation>
