      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3549_Start3" name="Strategic initiative requiring multiple projects (e.g., ERP rollout, net-zero/renewable…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3549_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3549_Task4" name="Program Manager/PMO establish the program: program charter, strategic…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Program Manager/PMO establish the program: program charter, strategic outcomes/benefits, component projects (links to W3546), inter-project dependencies, program governance, and the program roadmap; align to corporate strategy (links to VS-33) and transformation (links to VS-30)
Responsible (R): Program Manager / PMO
Accountable (A): Executive Sponsor
Duration: Per program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3549_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3549_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3549_Task5" name="Program Manager manage the program: coordinate component projects…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Program Manager manage the program: coordinate component projects (W3554–W3560), manage cross-project dependencies/sequencing (W3550), consolidated program budget/schedule/risk (links to VS-40), stakeholder communications (W3559), and benefit tracking (W3561); resolve escalations
Responsible (R): Program Manager / Project Managers
Accountable (A): Executive Sponsor
Duration: Program life</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3549_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3549_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3549_Task6" name="Program Manager/PMO conduct program reviews and stage-gates (W3548), report…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Program Manager/PMO conduct program reviews and stage-gates (W3548), report program status to governance (W3552), and close the program on outcome delivery with benefits realization (W3561) and lessons (W3560)
Responsible (R): Program Manager / PMO
Accountable (A): Executive Sponsor
Duration: Program life</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3549_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3549_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3549_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3549_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
