      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Portfolio review (W3547); risk/dependency cycle
Frequency: Continuous + monthly
Volume: Portfolio-wide
Owner: PMO / Risk
Participants: PMO, Risk (links to VS-21.2), Project Managers, Program Managers, Finance (links to VS-40), Sponsors
Source: workflow W3550 — Project Portfolio Risk, Dependency &amp; Conflict Management</bpmn:documentation>
