      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3550_Task4" name="PMO/Risk maintain the portfolio risk and dependency view: aggregate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PMO/Risk maintain the portfolio risk and dependency view: aggregate project/program risks (W3558), cross-project dependencies (technical, resource, schedule, scope), resource conflicts (W3553), and strategic/external risks; integrate to ERM (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): PMO / Risk
Accountable (A): PMO Director
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3550_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3550_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3550_Task5" name="PMO/Project Managers manage dependencies and conflicts: identify critical-path…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: PMO/Project Managers manage dependencies and conflicts: identify critical-path dependencies, manage resource conflicts (re-prioritize W3547 or resource W3553), resolve scope/schedule conflicts, and escalate to governance; mitigate portfolio-level risks
Responsible (R): PMO / Project Managers
Accountable (A): PMO Director
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3550_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3550_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3550_Task6" name="PMO report portfolio risk/dependency/conflict status to governance (W3552) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PMO report portfolio risk/dependency/conflict status to governance (W3552) and risk committee (links to VS-21.2/VS-36), track mitigation effectiveness, and feed learnings to planning (W3547) and methodology (W3548)
Responsible (R): PMO / Risk
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3550_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3550_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3550_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3550_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
