      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Prioritized project (W3547); initiation
Frequency: Per project
Volume: All approved projects
Owner: PMO / Finance
Participants: PMO, Sponsor, Finance (links to VS-40/VS-17.4), Strategy (links to VS-33), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Governance (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W3551 — Project Approval, Charter &amp; Business Case Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3551_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3551_Lane1" name="Sponsor">
