      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3551_Task5" name="Sponsor/PMO develop the project charter and business case: objectives/scope…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sponsor/PMO develop the project charter and business case: objectives/scope, deliverables, high-level plan and milestones, cost estimate (links to VS-40), benefits/ROI (W3561), risks/assumptions, sponsor/PM/stakeholders, and success criteria; align to strategy (links to VS-33)
Responsible (R): Sponsor / PMO / Finance
Accountable (A): PMO Director
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3551_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3551_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3551_Task6" name="PMO/Finance review the charter/business case for quality (completeness…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: PMO/Finance review the charter/business case for quality (completeness, realistic estimates, clear benefits, risk), validate against portfolio priorities (W3547) and the capex envelope (links to VS-40/W1814), and route for approval per authority (links to VS-36/VS-40/W1813)
Responsible (R): PMO / Finance
Accountable (A): PMO Director / CFO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3551_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3551_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3551_Task7" name="PMO capture the approval, baseline the project (scope/schedule/budget links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PMO capture the approval, baseline the project (scope/schedule/budget links to VS-40/W1814), issue the project charter/launch, and register in the PMIS (links to W3562) for delivery (PA-112.2); track the baseline for variance (W3564) and benefits (W3561)
Responsible (R): PMO
Accountable (A): PMO Director
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3551_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3551_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3551_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3551_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
